  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Photo proof exists, so this is a delivery dispute: escalate.\n\nThanks, Hana. You're verified, and I've looked at order Q-7501.\n\nThe courier's record shows the order was handed off at 7:02 PM. It was left at your door, and there's a photo of the bag at the door of apartment 1204. Because of that photo, I can't issue a refund or credit myself. I've escalated your case to a human specialist, who will review it and follow up with you within 24 hours. I can't promise what they'll decide.\n\nIn the meantime, please check around your door, with neighbors, and with your building's front desk or mail area. Is there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "The photo says it was at my door? I checked at 7:10 and there was nothing there. This building loses packages all the time, so I don't trust that photo. I want a full refund, not a 24 hour wait."
  },
  {
   "role": "agent",
   "text": "I understand why this is frustrating, Hana. You checked at 7:10 and nothing was there, and you'd like this settled now.\n\nI can't issue a refund when the delivery record includes a photo of the order at your door. That's true even though you say it never arrived. The policy requires a specialist to review these disputes, so I can't override it or speed it up. I've already escalated your case (reference ESC-700). It includes your 7:10 check and your concern about packages going missing in your building. A specialist will follow up within 24 hours. I can't promise how it will turn out.\n\nIt may help to ask your building management whether they hold packages or have door or lobby camera footage from around 7:02 PM. If you have that, you can share it with the specialist.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with?"
  },
  {
   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Okay, but I want it on record that I never got that pizza. I'm not happy about waiting a day for this. Fine, I'll ask the building about the lobby camera and send whatever they give me to the specialist. Thanks."
  }
